ull,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_7","text":"When we first met, we didn't know each other from Adam. We were completely green about the world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_8","text":"We fought a lot, laughed, cried, and shared a lot of emotional moments together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_9","text":"We went through a lot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_10","text":"We met the Commander and together, we fought to save humanity. People looked up to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_11","text":"There were bad times as well. Saying goodbye to friends and family who perished as the world fell apart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"lilith","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone_prologue_12","text":"There were many times when you wanted to give up. As did I.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,